# vLLM flags for the fmtcmp AGENTIC arm on Sparky: NVIDIA's DGX Spark recipe from the NVFP4 card (README "Quick
# Start"), verbatim except the port/host (set by the job script) and the drafter path.  The speculative block is
# appended by sparky_vllm_job.sh only with SPEC=lilicorr (the card's default); SPEC=none serves without a drafter.
# The video flags are kept although the eval is text-only, so the server is the card's server.
--served-model-name nemotron-3.5-super-vl
--max-num-seqs 1
--trust-remote-code
--gpu-memory-utilization 0.75
--max-num-batched-tokens 8192
--mamba-backend flashinfer
--mamba-ssm-cache-dtype float16
--enable-mamba-cache-stochastic-rounding
--mamba-cache-philox-rounds 5
--enable-mamba-shared-prefix-checkpoint
--video-pruning-rate 0.5
--media-io-kwargs {"video": {"fps": 2, "num_frames": 256}}
--block-size 64
--prefix-match-unit 64
--enable-auto-tool-choice
--tool-call-parser qwen3_coder
--reasoning-parser nemotron_v3
